  "description": "Asynchronous IPv4 network scanner that pings an IpAddressRange and exposes discovered devices as IObservable<NetworkDeviceInfo>. Uses ICMP (System.Net.NetworkInformation.Ping) with configurable timeout, reports scan progress via IObservable<int> (remaining pings), and resolves each live host to its IP address, MAC address, hostname, and device type. Depends on Oakrey.Network.Abstractions and Oakrey.Network.Tools.",
